The Honeydew Meadery produces beverages from wild-grown wheat and honeydews from [[Geography/Althane/Lunae Badlands/Hidden Gulch/Haven/index|Haven]]. Salesmen from the meadery travel both the town and the greater [[Geography/Althane/Lunae Badlands/Hidden Gulch/index|gulch]] to sell their alcohol in large kegs, and their ale can be found in most taverns in the [[Geography/Althane/Lunae Badlands/index|badlands]].
